                <p>This observation led him to explore <a href="https://freetexttovoiceai.in/marathi-free-text-to-voice-ai.html" class="text-blue-600 underline">Marathi AI voice</a> technology. He wanted a way to convert public domain stories and basic study notes into audio format without spending thousands of rupees on a recording studio or hiring a professional voice artist. He needed a tool where he could simply paste Marathi text and get natural-sounding audio back. This guide is built to help creators, students, and small business owners understand exactly how to do this.</p>
